{"3822860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover", "steam_appid": 3822860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far future of 2027, corporations battle for<i> world domination...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his home was to be demolished for new expensive condos, the lazy shark-man Biff Steaks resolves to put a stop to the madmen in charge. However, he would soon find himself caught in a power struggle between two rival companies. He's recruited by Sue Flay, a jaded professional who takes her work seriously. Together, they'll secure Mask Corporations spot as the number one syndicate in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.gif?t=1780409613\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.webm?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.mp4?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through armies of goons and unique bosses in a variety of levels! Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover combines the chaos of classic 2D beat em' ups with the freeform combat systems of character action games. Juggle enemies, use your environment, and unleash your powers to clear waves of enemies! Battle through unique environments led by their distinct bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Biff Steaks and utilize his fighting style which combines the human art of boxing with some signature moves of his own! Combine ducks and weaves with powerful blows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with Sue Flay, and slip through goons using her strange abilities! Each limb is a lethal weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" width=884 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.webm?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.mp4?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.webm?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.mp4?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for some overtime? Play co-op and enjoy some quality bonding time shooting for high scores in multiple arenas or go for the best time in boss rush mode! Select from a pool of eccentric characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.gif?t=1780409613\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. Fight bosses such as the undead Franky Furter, or the alien Ez Cargo! It's time to earn your pay!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo story campaign featuring two playable characters with unique movesets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcade mode that lets you and a friend take on the game together with any character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive combat that makes use of juggling, wallbouncing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple gamemodes that can be played solo or co-op including a versus mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique levels and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classy pixel art visuals</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far future of 2027, corporations battle for<i> world domination...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When his home was to be demolished for new expensive condos, the lazy shark-man Biff Steaks resolves to put a stop to the madmen in charge. However, he would soon find himself caught in a power struggle between two rival companies. He's recruited by Sue Flay, a jaded professional who takes her work seriously. Together, they'll secure Mask Corporations spot as the number one syndicate in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.gif?t=1780409613\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/dbb19a98a3e335431d246f2296bac0af.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.webm?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/fbee4ef939cea6f610a39ed29b5334b0.mp4?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through armies of goons and unique bosses in a variety of levels! Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover combines the chaos of classic 2D beat em' ups with the freeform combat systems of character action games. Juggle enemies, use your environment, and unleash your powers to clear waves of enemies! Battle through unique environments led by their distinct bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Biff Steaks and utilize his fighting style which combines the human art of boxing with some signature moves of his own! Combine ducks and weaves with powerful blows!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with Sue Flay, and slip through goons using her strange abilities! Each limb is a lethal weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" width=884 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.webm?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/d2047003c739b2573b20b8d7c572a4f9.mp4?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.webm?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/743c4d33e2e8c6104dc1dff66050fe8a.mp4?t=1780409613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for some overtime? Play co-op and enjoy some quality bonding time shooting for high scores in multiple arenas or go for the best time in boss rush mode! Select from a pool of eccentric characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.gif?t=1780409613\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/extras/c28c59d593402b8331b1c91f41583ce9.poster.avif?t=1780409613\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to escape this corporate conspiracy, you'll have to make some allies and enemies along the way. Fight bosses such as the undead Franky Furter, or the alien Ez Cargo! It's time to earn your pay!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo story campaign featuring two playable characters with unique movesets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcade mode that lets you and a friend take on the game together with any character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive combat that makes use of juggling, wallbouncing, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple gamemodes that can be played solo or co-op including a versus mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique levels and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classy pixel art visuals</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Bottom-Up Beatdown: Hostile Takeover is an intense 2D beat em' up set in a world dominated by corporations led by monsters! The only way out is up! Begin your freelance kaiju career in campaign mode, or play with friends in the traditional, challenging arcade mode!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/736ed1b6ed1633581ceea78ea31066d24129b00b/header.jpg?t=1780409613", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/f9229d6ff0997539027c088ae46393ed8d600dd1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780409613", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822860/f9229d6ff0997539027c088ae46393ed8d600dd1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780409613", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E8200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li>